<title>USA: Masco Corp Q4 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Masco Corp Q4 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>TAYLOR, Mich. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper Shr		   $0.52		    $0.06</p>
<p> Oper Net		  83,400		   10,650</p>
<p> Revs		     843,000		  754,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs			NA			 NA</p>
<p>					     Year</p>
<p> Oper Shr		   $1.84		    $1.25</p>
<p> Oper Net		 295,200		  200,050</p>
<p> Revs		   3,237,000		2,927,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 160,600		  159,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES - Results are from continuing operations. Q4 '96 net includes gain of $.02/shr from sale of MascoTech common stock and warrants, less charges related primarily to write-downs of miscellaneous assets intended for sale and plant relocation and closure costs.</p>
<p>'95 periods exclude $7.2 million loss from discontinued operations in Q4, and $8.3 million profit in full year. '95 results also exclude $650 million non-cash charge related to disposition of Home Furnishings Group.</p>
